<title>USA: Jitney-Jungle to buy Delchamps for $30/shr.</title>
<headline>Jitney-Jungle to buy Delchamps for $30/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MOBILE, Ala. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regional supermarket chain Jitney-Jungle Stores of America said Tuesday it would acquire all of the outstanding stock of Delchamps Inc for $30 a share.</p>
<p>Delchamps had about 7.12 million shares of common stock as of March 31.</p>
</text>
